WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.389
How can I sound confident without sounding rehearsed?

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:22.097
Lead with the outcome, then give one concrete reason. A little nuance makes you sound thoughtful, not uncertain. Acknowledge the trade-off, and finish with a clear recommendation.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.043
Nuance.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.637
I think we should probably launch the simple version first because it will let us understand what users actually need, and then later we can improve the complicated parts.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.318
I recommend launching the simpler version first. It will show us what users actually need, so we can improve the complex parts with real evidence.
